\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Foreign Reserves Rise On More Ctrl Bk Dlr Buying  \b0\par\par\uc2 295 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2004\par 15:38\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru continues to increase its international reserves, as among other things, the Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy U.S. dollars.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said late Friday that net international reserves totaled $10.518 billion on March 23, compared with $10.453 billion as of March 16.  \par \par \uc2 That increase was mainly due to open market purchases of U.S. dollars by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , it said.  \par \par \uc2 "We buy to make our level of international reserves more robust as part of a preventive policy," central reserve bank President Javier Silva Ruete said in a radio interview on Monday.  \par \par \uc2 "This will help protect the country from any speculative attacks," he added.  \par \par \uc2 So far this year, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has bought $632.5 million, aiming to ease appreciation of the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 To March 23, net international reserves have increased $324 million.  \par \par \uc2 In a report released Friday, Goldman Sachs (GS) noted that a strong rise in exports, substantial investments in the mining industry, and steady capital market access have allowed for consistent balance of payments surpluses, which the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has used to accumulate reserves.  \par \par \uc2 Peru's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  position was $5.144 billion as of March 23, $561 million higher than at the end of the previous year. Those funds don't include public sector deposits with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  or commercial bank reserves.  \par \par \uc2 The strong rise in that \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  position is "an important accomplishment in an economy still heavily dollarized," Goldman Sachs said.  \par \par \uc2 The sol appreciated by 1.1% in 2003, largely tied to low inflationary expectations and a burgeoning trade surplus.  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    -By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 511-221-7050; peru@dowjones.com \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 29-03-04 1338GMT ]  \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020040329e03t000qx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
