\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Sol Ends Weaker; Stock Market Falls  \b0\par\par\uc2 270 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Februar 2004\par 22:30\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's sol weakened slightly Friday when the Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy $9.5 million.  \par \par \uc2 The sol closed at a midrate of PEN3.4750 to the dollar on a spread of PEN3.4748-PEN3.4752.  \par \par \uc2 The sol closed the previous trading session at a midrate of PEN3.4746 to the dollar on a spread of PEN3.4741-PEN3.4750.  \par \par \uc2 So far this year, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has purchased $357 million.  \par \par \uc2 In its daily report, BBVA Banco Continental said it expected the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to continue to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  now that the dust has settled after several political scandals earlier this month.  \par \par \uc2 "The BCR will once again massively \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to try and avoid an exchange rate appreciation," it said.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also placed PEN205 million in overnight repurchase agreements, or repos, at an average annual rate of 2.49%.  \par \par \uc2 The key average overnight lending rate in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was 2.52% on Thursday.  \par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Lima's stock indexes fell Friday when some investors were discouraged by falling metals prices.  \par \par \uc2 The broad General Index closed 16.31 points, or 0.60%, lower at 2721.44.  \par \par \uc2 The blue chip Selective Index lost 26.28 points, or 0.57%, to end at 4595.66.  \par \par \uc2 Precious metals miner Buenaventura lost 3.4% to end at PEN85.50 as gold prices slid.  \par \par \uc2 Zinc miner Compania Minera Atacocha SA fell 0.6% to end at PEN1.73 on a downturn in zinc prices.  \par \par \uc2 -By Rebecca Howard, Dow Jones Newswires; 511-221-7050; peru@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 1071 1837  \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020040220e02k00058\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
