\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Sol Ends Stronger; Stock Market Higher  \b0\par\par\uc2 245 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Februar 2004\par 22:51\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's sol gained Tuesday on tight liquidity of the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , said traders.  \par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to purchase $500,000. That brought the total the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has purchased so far this year to $317.5 million.  \par \par \uc2 The sol closed at a midrate of PEN3.4756 to the dollar on a spread of PEN3.4752-PEN3.4760.  \par \par \uc2 The sol closed the previous trading session at a midrate of PEN3.4785 to the dollar on a spread of PEN3.4780-PEN3.4790.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also placed PEN155 million in overnight repurchase agreements, or repos, at an average annual rate of 2.57%.  \par \par \uc2 The key average overnight lending rate in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was 2.54% on Monday.  \par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Lima's stock indexes gained Tuesday as some blue-chip mining shares rose on higher metals prices.  \par \par \uc2 The broad General Index closed 7.28 points, or 0.26%, higher at 2769.27.  \par \par \uc2 The blue-chip Selective Index rose 41.19 points, or 0.89%, to end at 4673.89.  \par \par \uc2 Zinc miner Volcan SAA gained 2.2% to end at PEN0.94 on higher zinc prices while zinc miner Compania Minera Atacocha SA rose 3.5% to end at PEN1.77.  \par \par \uc2 Southern Peru Copper Corp. rose 1.7% to end at $41.70 on rising copper prices.  \par \par \uc2 -By Rebecca Howard, Dow Jones Newswires; 511-221-7050; peru@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 1071 1837  \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020040217e02h0004i\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\png