% to end at PEN8.50 on increased foreign interest, one market analyst said. \par \par \uc2  -By Virginia Rey-Sanchez, Dow Jones Newswires; 511-221-7050; peru@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1071 1837 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020030703dz7300cnm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
