\par\par \b \uc2  Peru's Stock Market, Sol Both End Stronger \b0\par\par\uc2 301 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 April 2003\par 23:02\par \uc2  Dow Jones Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2003, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  LIMA -(Dow Jones)- Peru's sol ended stronger Tuesday in medium-volume trading despite \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which bought $10 million, analysts said. \par \par \uc2  So far this year, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy a total of $356.2 million. \par \par \uc2  The sol closed at a midrate of PEN3.4603 to the dollar on a spread of PEN3.4600-PEN3.4605 to the dollar, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The sol closed the day before at a midrate 3.4618 to the dollar on a spread of PEN3.4615-PEN3.4520. \par \par \uc2  Liquidity was somewhat tight as the government placed PEN150 million in promissory notes on the local market, among other reasons, analysts said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  placed PEN40 million in overnight repurchase agreements, or repos, at an average rate of 3.78%. \par \par \uc2  The key average overnight lending rate in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was 3.81% Monday. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, Lima's stock indexes closed higher Tuesday as various blue chip shares rose. \par \par \uc2  The broad general Index closed 7.58 points or 0.43% stronger at 1769.25. \par \par \uc2  The blue chip Selective Index closed 7.43 points or 0.27% higher at 2754.60. \par \par \uc2  Precious metals miner Compania de Minas Buenaventura SAA rose 1.9% to end at PEN44.94. \par \par \uc2  Buenaventura reported net income of PEN186.26 million in the first quarter compared with PEN45.13 million in the same period of 2002. \par \par \uc2  Financial holding company Credicorp Ltd. rose 1.3% to end at $9.53. \par \par \uc2  Credicorp's main holding, Banco de Credito, said Tuesday that its net income fell to PEN12.2 million in the first quarter, compared with PEN59.3 million in the same period a year earlier. \par \par \uc2  -Virginia Rey-Sanchez, Dow Jones Newswires; 511-221-7050; peru@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1071 1837 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020030429dz4t009f4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
